Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] feat(DSv4.1): integrate decoder-side SWA bounded replay
 into the model

The layer loop becomes _run_layers plus _collapse, and the forward runs only up to decoder_replay_start,
handing the remaining layers to the replay path when enabled, with _decoder_replay_supported declining and
warning when the pipeline stage or parallelism setup cannot follow the smaller replay batch. Our SM80
fuse_mhc_all_reduce behaviour stays inside _collapse. Verified by importing the module and checking that all
four helpers and the property are class members.
---
 vllm/models/deepseek_v41/nvidia/model.py | 226 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 200 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

